{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772632284717,"story":{"title":"The Little Dragon's Big Find","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"eric-carle","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"collage_mixed","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"A small dragon lived in a big cave. He felt sad. He wanted to find fun. He wanted to find friends.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, purple dragon with big, sad eyes sits alone in a large, dark cave. The cave entrance is visible, showing a bright, sunny forest outside. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: dark blues and purples for the cave, bright greens and yellows for the outside.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772606257657,"durationMs":4487,"retries":0,"promptLength":785,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small sunny yellow scales with a pale orange belly dragon, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with sad expression, with Small, tarnished bronze collar with a tiny bell, Small, rounded horns that are light gold, Tiny, slightly mismatched wings (one slightly bigger than the other), A small patch of lighter yellow scales around his left eye, A slightly oversized tail with a small tuft of orange fur at the end, chubby build. Sparky the dragon sits alone in his large cave, looking dejected. in Inside a large, rocky cave. The entrance is visible but dark. The cave walls are rough and uneven.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"He flew out! Up, up, up he went. The dragon flew to find fun. He flew to find friends.","illustrationPrompt":"The little purple dragon is flying upwards, away from the cave. He has a determined expression. The sky is a bright blue with fluffy white clouds. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: bright blues and yel