all tuft of orange fur at the end, chubby build. Sparky takes a bite of a red fruit from a tree. in Next to a tree with bright red fruit, in the rocky landscape.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"He saw a small mouse. The mouse was sad. 'What is wrong?' asked the dragon. 'I lost my home,' said the mouse.","illustrationPrompt":"The little purple dragon is talking to a small, brown mouse. The mouse looks sad. The dragon looks concerned. They are standing near the base of the tree. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Color palette: greens and browns, soft pastels.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772606262782,"durationMs":5124,"retries":0,"promptLength":993,"success":true,"prompt":"collage illustration, mixed media art, textured paper cutouts, layered elements, creative composition, artistic mixed materials A small sunny yellow scales with a pale orange belly dragon, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with concerned expression, with Small, tarnished bronze collar with a tiny bell, Small, rounded horns that are light gold, Tiny, slightly mismatched wings (one slightly bigger than the other), A small patch of lighter yellow scales around his left eye, A slightly oversized tail with a small tuft of orange fur at the end, chubby build. A tiny fluffy light brown fur with a white patch on his chest mouse, small jet black eyes with sad expression, with A tiny, frayed blue ribbon tied around his tail, Large, round ears, A slightly twitchy nose, Long, thin whiskers, A small nick in his left ear, slim build. Sparky asks a sad Milo the mouse what is wrong. in Near a rock formation, in the rocky landscape.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"The dragon used his fire. He made a warm home! The mouse was glad. 'Thank you!' said the mouse. Now they are friends.","illustrationPrompt":"The little purple dragon is gently breathing